menu "FTier Memory Tiering Support"

config FTIER
	bool "FTier memory tiering for bandwidth expansion"
	depends on X86_64 && NUMA && MMU
	depends on NUMA_BALANCING && MIGRATION && TRANSPARENT_HUGEPAGE
	depends on CGROUPS
	help
	  FTier tiers application memory between DRAM and CXL-attached
	  memory to expand usable memory bandwidth. Hotness is tracked with
	  Adaptive Frequency Scanning of the accessed bits of upper-level
	  page table entries, and hot pages are migrated in the direction
	  requested by a tier latency monitor.

	  FTier is controlled at runtime through /sys/kernel/mm/ftier and is
	  inactive until enabled there.

	  If unsure, say N.

endmenu
